---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const headingFonts = [
  {
    name: 'Nothing You Could Do',
    family: "'Nothing You Could Do', cursive",
    size: '1.25rem',
    note: 'bolígrafo rápido, lo más parecido a Reenie Beenie',
  },
  {
    name: 'Shadows Into Light',
    family: "'Shadows Into Light', cursive",
    size: '1.55rem',
    note: 'rotulador fino, alto y estrecho',
  },
  {
    name: 'Caveat',
    family: "'Caveat', cursive",
    size: '1.6rem',
    note: 'la más legible y versátil, tiene pesos',
  },
  {
    name: 'Nanum Pen Script',
    family: "'Nanum Pen Script', cursive",
    size: '1.85rem',
    note: 'rotulador fino, muy de cuaderno',
  },
  {
    name: 'Covered By Your Grace',
    family: "'Covered By Your Grace', cursive",
    size: '1.6rem',
    note: 'trazo grueso, muy expresiva',
  },
  {
    name: 'Gochi Hand',
    family: "'Gochi Hand', cursive",
    size: '1.45rem',
    note: 'más gordita y amable',
  },
  {
    name: 'Homemade Apple',
    family: "'Homemade Apple', cursive",
    size: '1.15rem',
    note: 'cursiva real, mejor solo para firmas',
  },
  {
    name: 'Instrument Serif',
    family: "'Instrument Serif', serif",
    size: '1.6rem',
    italic: true,
    note: 'no es manuscrita: “editorial cálido”',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout title="Handmade lab · Elena Cabrera Casquet" noindex>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Caveat:wght@400;600&family=Covered+By+Your+Grace&family=Gochi+Hand&family=Homemade+Apple&family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Nanum+Pen+Script&family=Nothing+You+Could+Do&family=Shadows+Into+Light&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />

  <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
    <filter id="wobble">
      <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.035" numOctaves="2" seed="4" />
      <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" scale="3.2" />
    </filter>
    <filter id="wobble-strong">
      <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.05" numOctaves="2" seed="9" />
      <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" scale="5" />
    </filter>
  </svg>

  <main class="lab px-4 py-16 flex flex-col gap-16 max-w-[46rem] mx-auto">
    <header>
      <p class="section-title">lab / handmade</p>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Alternativas “handmade”</h1>
      <p class="prose-body mt-2">
        Cada bloque es una idea aislada aplicada a tu contenido real. Todo es CSS y algún SVG
        inline, sin dependencias nuevas. Al final hay tres recetas que combinan varias.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-01">
      <p class="lab-num">01 · tipografía</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Section headings manuscritos</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Tu idea, con tus títulos reales. Reenie Beenie ya no se sirve desde Google Fonts (la
        API devuelve 400), así que las dos primeras son las más parecidas que sí cargan.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-font-grid">
        {
          headingFonts.map((font) => (
            <div class="lab-font-card">
              <span
                class="lab-font-sample"
                style={`font-family:${font.family};font-size:${font.size};${font.italic ? 'font-style:italic;' : ''}`}
              >
                about me · work · tech stack
              </span>
              <span class="lab-font-name">{font.name}</span>
              <span class="lab-font-note">{font.note}</span>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-02">
      <p class="lab-num">02 · tipografía</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Mono + apunte a mano</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Mantienes Geist Mono y añades un comentario manuscrito al lado, como anotado después.
        Más sutil que cambiar la fuente entera.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <h3 class="section-title lab-mono-aside">
          about me <span class="lab-aside">the short version</span>
        </h3>
        <h3 class="section-title lab-mono-aside">work <span class="lab-aside">so far</span></h3>
        <h3 class="section-title lab-mono-aside">
          tech stack <span class="lab-aside">(go on, peel one)</span>
        </h3>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-03">
      <p class="lab-num">03 · tipografía</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Cursiva serif para los énfasis</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        El carácter puede venir de una voz más editorial: los énfasis en Instrument Serif
        itálica. Cero mantenimiento.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <p class="prose-body">
          I started out as a Business Consultant, but soon realized I'd rather
          <span class="lab-serif-em">build things</span> than make slides about them. Since then
          I've been working at <span class="lab-serif-em">tech startups</span>, mixing the
          <span class="lab-serif-em">technical</span> side with the
          <span class="lab-serif-em">people</span> side.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-04">
      <p class="lab-num">04 · marcas sobre el texto</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Subrayador fosforito</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Trazo de rotulador irregular detrás de las palabras clave. Solo CSS, y respeta los
        saltos de línea.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <p class="prose-body">
          Based in <mark class="lab-marker">Madrid</mark>, but originally from
          <mark class="lab-marker lab-marker--pink">Lanzarote</mark>. Always enjoyed building
          stuff and learning new things, I guess that's why I'm drawn to
          <mark class="lab-marker lab-marker--blue">startups and entrepreneurship</mark>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-05">
      <p class="lab-num">05 · marcas sobre el texto</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Subrayado garabateado en links</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Sustituye el underline recto por una línea ondulada. En “the blog” el trazo se dibuja
        al pasar el ratón.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <p class="prose-body">
          Always looking for a nice chat. Say hi on
          <a href="#alt-05" class="lab-squiggle">LinkedIn</a> or read
          <a href="#alt-05" class="lab-scribble-under">
            the blog
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path pathLength="100" d="M1 6.5 C 18 3, 30 8, 48 5.5 S 80 3, 99 5"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-06">
      <p class="lab-num">06 · marcas sobre el texto</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Círculo a boli alrededor de una palabra</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Un único trazo SVG que se dibuja al entrar en pantalla. Úsalo una sola vez en toda la
        web (por ejemplo en “Builder”) para que tenga gracia.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">hi, I'm Elena.</span> I am a
          <span class="lab-circled">
            Builder
            <svg viewBox="0 0 160 56" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                pathLength="100"
                d="M 22 10 C 60 1, 135 2, 152 20 C 166 36, 120 52, 70 51 C 22 50, 2 38, 9 22 C 14 11, 34 6, 52 6"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </span>. I enjoy creating software products and solving problems in creative ways.
        </p>
        <button type="button" class="lab-replay" data-replay="alt-06">repetir animación</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-07">
      <p class="lab-num">07 · marcas sobre el texto</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Tachones y correcciones</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Tachar una palabra y corregirla a mano encima. Encaja con el tono de “honestly, not
        very good at it”.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo space-y-8">
        <p class="prose-body">
          I started out as a <span class="lab-struck">Business Consultant</span><span
            class="lab-caret"
            data-note="builder">^</span
          >, but soon realized I'd rather build things than make slides about them.
        </p>
        <p class="prose-body">
          Occasionally <span class="lab-struck">surfing</span><span
            class="lab-caret"
            data-note="falling off a board">^</span
          >… but honestly, not very good at it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-08">
      <p class="lab-num">08 · anotaciones</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Notas al margen con flechas</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Comentarios manuscritos fuera de la columna. Además pueden ser útiles: ahora mismo
        nadie descubre que los stickers se despegan.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo lab-demo--margin">
        <ul class="lab-stickers">
          <li><img src="/assets/images/stack/python.webp" alt="" /><span>Python</span></li>
          <li><img src="/assets/images/stack/fastapi.png" alt="" /><span>FastAPI</span></li>
          <li><img src="/assets/images/stack/vuejs.webp" alt="" /><span>Vue.js</span></li>
          <li><img src="/assets/images/stack/react.webp" alt="" /><span>React</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="lab-margin-note">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 80 50" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M74 8 C 52 2, 30 10, 26 26 C 23 38, 14 42, 6 40"></path>
            <path d="M12 34 L 5 40 L 13 45"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>psst… you can<br />peel these off</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-09">
      <p class="lab-num">09 · anotaciones</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Firma al final</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Cierra la home con tu firma. Aquí es Homemade Apple con un reveal de izquierda a
        derecha; la versión buena sería tu firma real vectorizada.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <p class="prose-body">
          Always looking for a nice chat. Say hi on <span class="font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-zinc-300">LinkedIn</span>.
        </p>
        <p class="lab-signature" aria-label="Elena">Elena</p>
        <button type="button" class="lab-replay" data-replay="alt-09">repetir animación</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-10">
      <p class="lab-num">10 · materiales</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Foto tipo polaroid con cinta</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Borde blanco, un par de grados de rotación, sombra suave y un trozo de washi tape. Se
        endereza al pasar el ratón.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo flex gap-6 items-start">
        <figure class="lab-polaroid">
          <span class="lab-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <img src="/assets/images/profile/me.jpg" alt="" />
        </figure>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-zinc-400 pt-2">
          <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">hi, I'm Elena.</span> I am a
          Builder. I enjoy creating software products and solving problems in creative ways.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-11">
      <p class="lab-num">11 · materiales</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Papel: blanco cálido + grano</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Cambiar el blanco puro por un blanco roto y un ruido SVG muy fino. Es lo que más cambia
        la sensación con menos esfuerzo. El grano de estas muestras está exagerado para que se
        vea; en la web real iría a la mitad.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-paper-grid">
        <div class="lab-paper" style="background:#ffffff"><span>#ffffff · actual</span></div>
        <div class="lab-paper lab-grain" style="background:#fbfaf7"><span>#fbfaf7 + grano</span></div>
        <div class="lab-paper lab-grain" style="background:#f7f4ee"><span>#f7f4ee + grano</span></div>
        <div class="lab-paper lab-grain lab-paper--dark" style="background:#141311">
          <span>dark: #141311 + grano</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-12">
      <p class="lab-num">12 · materiales</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Bordes temblorosos</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Un filtro SVG (turbulencia + desplazamiento) hace que un borde o un icono parezca
        dibujado a mano. Sirve para tarjetas, separadores e iconos sociales.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="lab-sketch-card">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">markdown-os</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            View and edit Markdown files in the browser, improving on IDE default preview.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 justify-center">
          <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
            <span class="lab-tiny-label">sin filtro</span>
            <span class="lab-icons">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4"></rect><path d="M8 10v6M8 7v.01M12 16v-4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v4M12 10v6"></path></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9 19c-3 1-3-1.5-4-2M15 21v-3a3 3 0 0 0-1-2.5c3-.3 5-1.5 5-5a4 4 0 0 0-1-3 3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-3s-1 0-3 1.3a10 10 0 0 0-6 0C7 4.5 6 4.5 6 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 3 4 4 0 0 0-1 3c0 3.5 2 4.7 5 5a3 3 0 0 0-1 2.5v3"></path></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4l16 16M20 4L4 20"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4 items-center">
            <span class="lab-tiny-label">con filtro</span>
            <span class="lab-icons lab-icons--wobble">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="4"></rect><path d="M8 10v6M8 7v.01M12 16v-4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0v4M12 10v6"></path></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9 19c-3 1-3-1.5-4-2M15 21v-3a3 3 0 0 0-1-2.5c3-.3 5-1.5 5-5a4 4 0 0 0-1-3 3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-3s-1 0-3 1.3a10 10 0 0 0-6 0C7 4.5 6 4.5 6 4.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 3 4 4 0 0 0-1 3c0 3.5 2 4.7 5 5a3 3 0 0 0-1 2.5v3"></path></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 4l16 16M20 4L4 20"></path></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-13">
      <p class="lab-num">13 · materiales</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Post-it para lo que está por venir</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        La tarjeta “more coming…” de projects como nota adhesiva. Un solo objeto con
        personalidad dentro de una sección sobria.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
        <div class="lab-sketch-card lab-sketch-card--plain">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">markdown-os</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1">
            View and edit Markdown files in the browser.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="lab-postit">
          <span>more coming…</span>
          <small>(currently cooking something with agents)</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-14">
      <p class="lab-num">14 · materiales</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Sello de goma</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Un sello entintado, con la tinta rota por una máscara de ruido, para marcar el trabajo
        actual o un post nuevo.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[7.5rem_1fr] gap-x-5 gap-y-2 items-start">
          <span class="work-date">2026 — Now</span>
          <div class="min-w-0 relative">
            <h3 class="work-role">
              <span>Founding Engineer</span>
              <span class="work-role__at">@</span>
              <span class="work-company">
                <img
                  src="/assets/images/work/quentax.png"
                  alt=""
                  width="16"
                  height="16"
                  class="work-company__logo"
                />
                <span>Quentax</span>
              </span>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 prose-body">
              Building the AI workforce for the accounting firms of the future.
            </p>
            <span class="lab-stamp">now</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-15">
      <p class="lab-num">15 · estructura</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Separadores dibujados</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Entre secciones, un trazo distinto cada vez. Da ritmo sin añadir contenido.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo flex flex-col gap-6 items-center">
        <svg class="lab-divider" viewBox="0 0 200 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8 C 20 2, 30 13, 50 7 S 80 2, 100 8 S 140 13, 160 6 S 190 4, 198 8"></path></svg>
        <svg class="lab-divider lab-divider--short" viewBox="0 0 60 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 3 L 33 10 L 40 11 L 34 15 L 36 20 M30 3 L 27 10 L 20 11 L 26 15 L 24 20"></path></svg>
        <svg class="lab-divider" viewBox="0 0 200 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7 L 198 7 M 6 10 L 194 9"></path></svg>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="alt-16">
      <p class="lab-num">16 · detalles</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Pequeños detalles de “alguien cuidó esto”</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">
        Cosas que casi nadie nombra pero que se sienten: la selección de texto en fosforito, el
        footer firmado, y una fecha de la última vez que regaste la web.
      </p>
      <div class="lab-demo flex flex-col gap-5">
        <p class="prose-body lab-selection">
          Selecciona este texto: el highlight usa el mismo amarillo del subrayador en vez del
          azul por defecto del navegador.
        </p>
        <footer class="lab-footer">
          <span>© 2026 Elena Cabrera Casquet</span>
          <span class="lab-footer__hand">
            made by hand in Madrid
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20s-7-4.5-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.5A4 4 0 0 1 19 10c0 5.5-7 10-7 10z"></path></svg>
          </span>
          <span class="lab-footer__mono">last watered · nov 2026</span>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block" id="recipes">
      <p class="lab-num">recetas</p>
      <h2 class="lab-h">Tres combinaciones</h2>
      <p class="lab-desc">La misma home, tres intensidades. De más a menos manuscrito.</p>

      <div class="lab-recipes">
        <article class="mock mock--notebook">
          <p class="mock-label">A · cuaderno <span>01 + 04 + 07 + 08 + 09 + 11</span></p>
          <div class="mock-hero">
            <figure class="lab-polaroid lab-polaroid--sm">
              <span class="lab-tape" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <img src="/assets/images/profile/me.jpg" alt="" />
            </figure>
            <p>
              <b>hi, I'm Elena.</b> I am a Builder. I enjoy creating software products and solving problems in creative ways.
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mock-h">about me</h3>
          <p class="mock-p">
            Based in <mark class="lab-marker">Madrid</mark>, but originally from
            <mark class="lab-marker lab-marker--pink">Lanzarote</mark>. Occasionally
            <span class="lab-struck">surfing</span><span class="lab-caret" data-note="falling off a board">^</span>… not very good at it.
          </p>
          <h3 class="mock-h">work</h3>
          <div class="mock-row">
            <span class="work-date">2026 — Now</span>
            <span><b>Founding Engineer</b> <span class="text-zinc-400">@</span> Quentax</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mock-p mt-6">
            Always looking for a nice chat. Say hi on <a class="lab-squiggle" href="#recipes">LinkedIn</a>.
          </p>
          <p class="lab-signature lab-signature--static">Elena</p>
        </article>

        <article class="mock mock--editorial">
          <p class="mock-label">B · editorial cálido <span>03 + 10 + 11 + 14 + 15</span></p>
          <div class="mock-hero">
            <figure class="lab-polaroid lab-polaroid--sm">
              <img src="/assets/images/profile/me.jpg" alt="" />
            </figure>
            <p>
              <b>hi, I'm Elena.</b> I am a <i>Builder</i>. I enjoy creating software products and solving problems in creative ways.
            </p>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mock-h">About me</h3>
          <p class="mock-p">
            Based in <i>Madrid</i>, but originally from <i>Lanzarote</i>. Always enjoyed building
            stuff and learning new things.
          </p>
          <svg class="lab-divider lab-divider--mock" viewBox="0 0 200 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8 C 20 2, 30 13, 50 7 S 80 2, 100 8 S 140 13, 160 6 S 190 4, 198 8"></path></svg>
          <h3 class="mock-h">Work</h3>
          <div class="mock-row relative">
            <span class="work-date">2026 — Now</span>
            <span><b>Founding Engineer</b> <span class="text-zinc-400">@</span> Quentax</span>
            <span class="lab-stamp lab-stamp--sm">now</span>
          </div>
          <p class="mock-p mt-6">Always looking for a <i>nice chat</i>. Say hi on LinkedIn.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="mock mock--subtle">
          <p class="mock-label">C · sutil <span>02 + 04 + 06 + 08 + 09 + 11 + 12</span></p>
          <div class="mock-hero">
            <img class="mock-avatar" src="/assets/images/profile/me.jpg" alt="" />
            <p>
              <b>hi, I'm Elena.</b> I am a
              <span class="lab-circled lab-circled--static">
                Builder
                <svg viewBox="0 0 160 56" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path
                    pathLength="100"
                    d="M 22 10 C 60 1, 135 2, 152 20 C 166 36, 120 52, 70 51 C 22 50, 2 38, 9 22 C 14 11, 34 6, 52 6"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
              </span>. I enjoy creating software products and solving problems in creative ways.
            </p>
          </div>
