            Based in <mark class="lab-marker">Madrid</mark>, but originally from Lanzarote.
            Always enjoyed building stuff and learning new things.
          </p>
          <h3 class="section-title lab-mono-aside mt-6">
            tech stack <span class="lab-aside">(go on, peel one)</span>
          </h3>
          <ul class="lab-stickers lab-stickers--sm">
